{
 "_doc": "Physical material classes for the ray tracer (client/src/rt/rt_materials.c, doc/raytracing.md). Read only while ray tracing is on; rtMode 0 never sees it. Keys: textures = the texture file's base name without directory or extension ('wall_0', 'wall_0_3', 'weapon_2', 'melee_0_5'); models = model path relative to assets ('models/weapons/weapon_2.obj'); weapons = weapon id; parts = player part; paint = paintShader id. Globs use '*' only. Within a section the FIRST matching rule in file order wins, so exceptions sit above the glob they override. Precedence paint > weapons > models > textures > parts > default. Authoring: tools/rt-materials/README.md. Class keys: metalness, roughness, reflect (0..4, 0 = no reflection ray), f0 (optional), bump (optional, 0..2: strength of the relief normal map generated from the texture's luminance, rt_normals.c; absent = 0).",
